      <p>As the load increases by 1000 QPS, the hosted control plane resource utilization increases by 9 vCPUs and 2.5 GB memory.</p>
      <p>For general sizing purposes, consider the 1000 QPS API rate that is a <em>medium</em> hosted cluster load, and a 2000 QPS API that is a <em>heavy</em> hosted cluster load.</p>
